    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skies of Aevium</strong> is a 2D survival crafting game with a heavy focus on Greek Mythology where you can automate<strong><i>\u00a0anything</i></strong>\u00a0if you want to.<strong>\u00a0</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After accidentally challenging Zeus to a bet, you now find yourself in a new world that's all yours. Start on a small patch of land and expand. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32Gather resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0fCraft items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6Complete quests </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1Meet the Olympian gods </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80Travel to the Underworld </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0fAutomate anything, from mining minerals to managing farms<br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0fFight mythological creatures </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\udebdMeet iconic characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8Customize your character to your liking </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skies of Aevium</strong> is a 2D survival crafting game with a heavy focus on Greek Mythology where you can automate<strong><i>\u00a0anything</i></strong>\u00a0if you want to.<strong>\u00a0</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After accidentally challenging Zeus to a bet, you now find yourself in a new world that's all yours. Start on a small patch of land and expand. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf32Gather resources </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0fCraft items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6Complete quests </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1Meet the Olympian gods </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80Travel to the Underworld </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0fAutomate anything, from mining minerals to managing farms<br> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0fFight mythological creatures </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83e\udebdMeet iconic characters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8Customize your character to your liking </p></li></ul>",
